<title>BELGIUM: EU cereals experts to open export tenders.</title>
<headline>EU cereals experts to open export tenders.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's cereals management committee will on Thursday open special measure export tenders for 100,000 tonnes of durum wheat and 100,000 tonnes of Greek maize,  an EU official said.</p>
<p>&quot;The committee will also open two annual tenders for manioc from Thailand and from other third countries as well as for sweet potatoes and for manioc starch,&quot; the offcial said.</p>
</text>
